    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Old Oak Cottage is situated in a secluded section of an ancient Oak Grove with sea frontage onto Ardgroom Harbour. The house commands views of Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island and provides a rare opportunity to purchase a residence with shoreline frontage onto Kenmare Bay . The property is being sold complete with a substantial suite of contents. Situated on 3.16 hectares (1.28 acres) , the grounds immediately around the house have been landscaped with remainder of the land containing an ancient oak woodland.Sitting on the expansive front patio, you can enjoy the westerly views of Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island. Pathways have been created on the western part of the lands so you can explore the woodlands and rocky shoreline. The shoreline contains some small coves that are ideal for bathing at high tide or mooring a small boat.The Old Oak Cottage was originally built in 1996 with an extension added in 2005. Accommodation is over two floors with an internal floor area of about 201.40 sq.mt (2,168 sq. ft). The ground floor consists of: Porch leading onto open plan living room, sitting room/dining room, kitchen / dining area, utility, wc. The first floor comprises of 2 bedrooms and a bathroom. Also on the grounds are a double garage and garden shed.Collorus is an area popular with walkers, cyclists and outdoor enthusiasts, attracted by this area of immense scenic beauty. The property is 19.3km east of Castletownbere and is 29.2km west of Kenmare Town centre. 5.4km Ardgroom Village. 6.3km to Derreen Gardens. 8.9 km of Kilmackillogue pier with Helen's bar & restaurant. 8.5km of Josie's Restaurant. 6.2km of Shibin Restaurant. VIEWING BY APPOINTMENT ONLY**Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nNote 1 - \nRoom measurements are as per floor plan.\n\nNote 2 - \nMap and photos indicating boundaries are for illustration purposes only.\n\nGround Floor - \n\n\nPorch - \nSpacious entrance hall with stairs to first floor. Tiled floor.\n\nWC - \nW.C., W.H.B. Tiled floor.\n\nLiving Room - \nSpacious living space which flows into sitting room / dining room, kitchen / dining area. Views of Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island. French doors leading to front patio. Oak style floor finish.\n\nSitting room/ dining room - \nViews of Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island. French doors leading to front patio. Oak style floor finish. TV point.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - \nLarge Bay windows with views of Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island. Fully fitted kitchen. Suite of appliances. Oak style floor finish.\n\nUtility Room - \nGlass door to front patio. Worktop with sink and storage presses. Washing & machine dryer. Oak style floor finish.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nViews to side garden. Ash style floor finish. Telephone point. Currently being used as a home office.\n\nBedroom 3 En-suite - \nSea views. W.C., W.H.B. Corner shower. Tiled floor.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - \nLarge spacious bedroom suite with 4 windows which fills the room with natural light. Two of the windows overlook Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island. Timber flooring. T.V point.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nViews of Ardgroom Harbour and Brird Island. Timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - \nW.C., W.H.B. Bath with shower. Skylight window.\n\nOutbuildings - \n\n\nGarage - \n7.04m x 5.95m = 41.89 sq.mt (450 sq. ft). Double garage with lofted store area. Concrete block wall and tiled roof. Two automatic roll up doors. Ladder to loft area. Work bench and shelving. Lighting and electric sockets.\n\nGarden Shed - \n3.46m x 2.40m = 8.30 sq.mt (98 sq. ft). Timber garden shed. Work bench. Lighting and electric sockets.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 bed detached house with sea frontage.</li><li>Views of Ardgroom Harbour and Bird Island</li><li>3.16 acres (1.28 hectares) of grounds.</li><li></li><li>Services: Electricity. Water supply is via bored well on site . Sewage is by septic tank. Oil central heating. SCC wireless broadband in the area. Fibre broadband also recently available in the area.</ul>"
      },
